{
 "id": "267-29",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "It's a great way to stay connected and have efficient conversations.",
  "It's important for consistency and readability.",
  "One of the key things I want you to focus on is function argument names.",
  "Always start them with 'i_'.",
  "This helps us easily identify input variables and maintain a consistent style.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.",
  "We'll work at a pace that's comfortable for you, and I'll provide guidance and feedback along the way.",
  "We need to embrace change as an opportunity rather than a threat.",
  "When a new technology comes along, for example, we should approach it with curiosity and a willingness to learn.",
  "It's also important to cultivate a growth mindset, understanding that our skills and knowledge can always be developed and improved.",
  "Instead of trying to master everything at once, focus on understanding one concept or completing one tutorial at a time.",
  "Going forward, I want you to add the '@timer_class' decorator from the 'pedantic' module to all your classes.",
  "I'm here to support you and provide guidance whenever needed.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if there's anything at all that you'd like clarification on or if you simply want to discuss any new concepts or ideas.",
  "I want you to start incorporating annotations into your method definitions.",
  "It's a habit that will soon become second nature.",
  "Just remember that clear and concise annotations are best."
 ],
 "admitted": 17,
